Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 09:00:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Shared kills in a group (setting, default on; essential NPCs
 stay alive), invite guards (no accepts without a pending invite, no invites
 to party members, rate limits, no repeated 'expired' spam)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
